<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Hello&nbsp;{!Contact.FirstName}</font><span style="font-family: arial;">,</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: arial;"><br></span></div><div><div><div><font face="arial">Thank you for contacting Admission Services at Arizona State University. Only the student who applied can request to cancel the application. Your student may submit a request by logging in to <a href="https://students.asu.edu/canceladmissions">students.asu.edu/canceladmissions</a> with his or her ASURITE UserID and password. Students who have forgotten their ASURITE ID or password may call the Help Desk at 480-965-6500 to reset their password.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">A student who is unable to access the form may email a request to <a href="mailto:decline@asu.edu"><b>decline@asu.edu</b></a> using the email of record with ASU (the one entered on the application) or offical asu.edu email address, including either their ASU ID number or date of birth (mm/dd/yy). This information verifies that we are canceling the correct student’s application.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Your student can contact his or her personal admission representative at <a href="https://asu.edu/findmyrep">asu.edu/findmyrep</a> with any questions.</font></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Sincerely,</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Admission Services</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><a href="http://www.asu.edu/">asu.edu</a></font></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div><div style="font-size: medium; font-family: 'Times New Roman';"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">If you would like any additional information or have questions related to this subject, please reply to this email.</font></div><div style="font-size: medium; font-family: 'Times New Roman';"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666"><br></font></div><div style="font-size: medium; font-family: 'Times New Roman';"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>